    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "stop trying to fix myself? i don't even know if i want to anymore. it's just so much work to keep pretending like things are okay. sometimes i look at the door and just think... wouldn't it be easier if I just didn't have to carry this weight around anymore? like, if i could just fade away into that silence you mentioned.",
